2.3 Persistent field selector contract
The field selector is a primary navigation control, not an ordinary metric card. It shows:
- Field name and stable field ID in technical details.
- Farm name.
- Mapped area and geometry version.
- Boundary completeness/validity.
- Current crop and variety only when confirmed.
