Switching field updates all field-dependent content together: crop occurrence, crop stage, Kc, weather sampling context, soil properties, water calculations, vegetation raster/date, risks, alerts, actions, journal, reports and active rotation. Keep farm-wide cards labelled as farm-wide while a field is selected. Preserve farmId, fieldId, section, period, rotation ID, crop-occurrence ID and report ID in route/state context.
